<p local-id=3D"01a8d9d4e6d8">Theft, vandalism, and site-security failures</=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"765ddb4e-e895-4a9d-a0d7-10d65e595add" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b4430744dfef">Not separately quantified</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"573f3e7c-4901-48b7-ad34-2caff93abe52" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ea0311b84fc7">Not separately quantified</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"79a393ac-69dd-4d20-9cae-5572f2e6caf6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e8f58d9222bb">Common during partially secured construction a=
nd may involve inventory, access, and security-control failures</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"555702bd-cb49-4e63-9ed9-f3231a9e7f47">
<td data-local-id=3D"50828f64-3ed8-4d81-b2c8-ba9ac53bdf25" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a086d75c9d65"><strong>9</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"40c51cd4-332b-49a3-bef7-76bd69dc8fd7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"07fb138b7a9c">Construction accidents and unsafe conditions</=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5b8035c6-ee6d-4abe-bbc0-61b53efea240" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c7540d5bc95e">Often handled under workers=E2=80=99 compensat=
ion or general liability rather than engineering property claims</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c8a6397f-5092-458c-aa19-a7bbd59fb3a5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4c44dc8014cd">Not directly comparable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8055d7c2-4345-4f85-8686-f7f24a133d01" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f7dc8e1aba9c">High injury, fatality, liability, and regulato=
ry exposure</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"62314f27-0da5-48a6-9f91-08573fae908a">
<td data-local-id=3D"c0284ede-08c8-44f7-8abf-69376270b6ac" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8260e8dff7dd"><strong>10</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"78606469-2227-4f32-9500-300df1444476" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8914986a4f1a">Schedule, coordination, and change-management =
failures</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"41c7c1ac-a225-4074-a180-ac63d3388bae" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"30e3b2e36463">Usually embedded in delay, professional liabil=
ity, or builder=E2=80=99s-risk claims</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"39c0033b-be13-4549-a5cb-1bb1eda618c1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46dbcbdf422f">Often difficult to isolate</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc0fcd71-25bd-44ae-b190-c4b898b20984" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b0d103134f7">Can create delay, acceleration cost, concurren=
t-delay disputes, and business-interruption losses</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"8fbff81ec64e"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"219b06840110" id=3D"Rootcauseanalysis(RCA)acrossindustries:=
Commonprinciples,traditionalmethods,commercialofferingslandscapeandcasestud=
ies-Section3.OverviewoftraditionalRCAmethods">Section 3. Overview of tradit=
ional RCA methods</h2>
<p local-id=3D"a50639b4cabf">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"18c2478bf2a4">These traditional RCA methods below are covere=
d as part of RCA certifications and can be applied to both manual debugging=
 and AI-assisted analysis. They provide a structured approach to analyzing =
collected evidence, identifying contributing factors, and determining the u=
nderlying root cause.</p>
<p local-id=3D"1f15b731a1e0">&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e4=
9ead3e-545a-4ddb-a202-5d3dc15c9660" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 297.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 462.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"47433550-5128-4afc-8a1e-2fed13d70524">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#156082" data-local-id=3D"41194b98-733c-41a2-9=
e41-f9efa4a58d54" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"293aeb063059"><span style=3D"color: rgb(255,255,255);">Tool/=
Technology</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#156082" data-local-id=3D"ecfcd313-1c47-4b9b-b=
82d-71cf2807a0a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"197669208660"><span style=3D"color: rgb(255,255,255);">Descr=
iption</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"df0f86ef-caee-4920-a111-406a10e3281b">
<td data-local-id=3D"bd3b15dc-ba3b-4c25-8eae-726951648c15" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eaf9348f7521">5 Whys</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c99b9c96-f6c7-4185-8280-00e68d9b0592" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"395c0cf319bd">Identifies the root cause by asking =E2=80=9CW=
hy=E2=80=9D multiple times</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"88fb81c3-ad96-4d56-a5d2-f576c4d8296e">
<td data-local-id=3D"59839181-fdc1-4526-89e8-88f3bd968913" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b66625db1d8">Fishbone/Ishikawa diagram</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"353532fd-e792-40e3-80a6-ba265b4c56e8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"05c137f10e70">The fishbone diagram/Ishikawa diagram, is a ro=
ot cause analysis tool that helps teams identify possible causes of a probl=
em across six categories: <em><strong>methods, people, material, machine, m=
easurement, and environment</strong></em>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0b9fe0e5-4560-47ca-8a54-ca1905a66f3e">
<td data-local-id=3D"303d82f0-b7ac-485d-bf95-59b946994cdb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d50d2dec5020">Fault tree analysis</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"54ec5c34-0528-4b95-a91d-9c2ae3d64752" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"63da442756b6">Identifies the specific combination of events =
that caused a problem by tracing contributors through logical relationships=
 until the root causes are reached. Probabilities are then calculated throu=
gh the tree to determine the likelihood of the problem occurring.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0f626dd0-36a3-4b06-8f2a-73a481035f29">
<td data-local-id=3D"81401be3-4ae5-4959-95d0-8f4671e97812" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"064865dfc39f">Pareto analysis</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e0a6727-90ea-47fe-bd74-4f36b1d744fc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3eb8c3ef8f3c">The Pareto chart applies the 80/20 rule, which=
 suggests that roughly 80% of problems come from 20% of causes. This helps =
identify and prioritize the issues with the greatest impact.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper =
confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image im=
age-center" alt=3D"image-20260923-150104.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy=
