<p local-id=3D"b491751693d6"><strong><span style=3D"color: rgb(255,255,255)=
;">Superintendent Logs / RFIs can reveal</span></strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#156082" data-local-id=3D"df7f3e36-b6e6-4e8a-9=
